`root:` takes one legal value, and an unknown one is named alongside the set it had to come
from rather than falling back to the vault.

-- fixtures/cwd/.booping --
project_name: probe
vault_path: ./vault
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/config.yaml --
core:
  probe_playbook:
    queries:
      plans:
        glob:
          - plans/*/index.md
        root: bogus
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/plans/alpha/index.md --
---
title: Alpha
---

body
-- cmd --
booping query --config core.probe_playbook.queries.plans
-- exit --
1
-- stdout --
-- stderr --
error: invalid query spec from config path core.probe_playbook.queries.plans: unknown query root: 'bogus' (expected one of: core)
